{"5042160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Town", "steam_appid": 5042160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Zombie Town</i>, you venture alone into a fallen lakeside town. Rely on your wits, firepower and courage to fight for survival amid a zombie‑ravaged apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desolate abandoned streets, scattered weapons and supplies, and deadly threats lurking in the shadows await you. But remember — death follows every step. Stay alert and stay prepared, or you will fall into the horrifying abyss of <i>Zombie Town</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim to recreate the tense, oppressive atmosphere of apocalyptic survival for new‑generation players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Veteran players will also find familiar end‑times peril within this overrun town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a newcomer to the apocalypse or a battle‑hardened survivor, grab your weapons, lock and load, and step bravely into the death‑shrouded lands of <i>Zombie Town</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill Zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Tab to open your inventory. Right-click to select your weapon of choice and click [Equip] to hold it. Right-click to aim, then left-click to shoot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042160/extras/41a43d925f56371ad248a3f3ab46f29d.avif?t=1787908953\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042160/extras_big/41a43d925f56371ad248a3f3ab46f29d.avif?t=1787908953 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save Point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find a computer inside houses throughout the game. Use it wisely to save your progress — it'll make exploration much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042160/extras/fff3868b9c76a4431cb0b1843826c81a.avif?t=1787908953\" width=1326 height=605 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Zombie Town</i>, you venture alone into a fallen lakeside town. Rely on your wits, firepower and courage to fight for survival amid a zombie‑ravaged apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desolate abandoned streets, scattered weapons and supplies, and deadly threats lurking in the shadows await you. But remember — death follows every step. Stay alert and stay prepared, or you will fall into the horrifying abyss of <i>Zombie Town</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim to recreate the tense, oppressive atmosphere of apocalyptic survival for new‑generation players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Veteran players will also find familiar end‑times peril within this overrun town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a newcomer to the apocalypse or a battle‑hardened survivor, grab your weapons, lock and load, and step bravely into the death‑shrouded lands of <i>Zombie Town</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill Zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Tab to open your inventory. Right-click to select your weapon of choice and click [Equip] to hold it. Right-click to aim, then left-click to shoot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042160/extras/41a43d925f56371ad248a3f3ab46f29d.avif?t=1787908953\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5042160/extras_big/41a43d925f56371ad248a3f3ab46f29d.avif?t=1787908953 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save Point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find a computer inside houses throughout the game. Use it wisely to save your progress — it'll make exploration much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im